   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I think it should still work even if you define elements with a loop/lapply.  I&#39;m not on a computer now to test but I&#39;m pretty sure there&#39;s a way to get it working nicely</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br clear=\"all\"><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>---</div><div><a href=\"http://deanattali.com\" style=\"font-size:12.8000001907349px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://deanattali.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792398758583000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1_xg4KmFkskyMo92Aif39i\">http://deanattali.com</a><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
